@startuml
[*] --> PowerOn : power-on event
PowerOn --> ReadyToUse : everything is fine during startup
PowerOn --> Normal : problem during startup
ReadyToUse --> Monitoring : user activation request
Monitoring --> Normal : sensor trigger and false alarm or time ends
Monitoring --> Normal : user turn-off request
ReadyToUse --> Normal : user enters password
Normal --> [*] : final state
@enduml
